title: "R - Student Analysis"
# Find the exact AppData path with forward slashes
appdata_path <- gsub("\\\\", "/", Sys.getenv("APPDATA"))
tinytex_folder <- paste0(appdata_path, "/TinyTeX")
# Print the path to confirm it looks correct
print(tinytex_folder)
# Delete the folder completely
unlink(tinytex_folder, recursive = TRUE, force = TRUE)
This project is about analysis on students data to get summary, plots/graphs etc. related to the data.
